PATCH {{base}}/fan/me
Authorization: Bearer {{karimToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"display_name": "Karim", "locale": "fr"}

### 7.6 Karim: joins
PUT {{base}}/fan/me/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{karimToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"organizer_id": "{{org}}", "marketing_push": false, "marketing_whatsapp": true}

