Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "{{aminePhone}}", "code": "{{code}}"}

> {% client.global.set("amineToken", response.body.token); %}

### 7.9 Amine: joins with no opt-in (never exported)
PUT {{base}}/fan/me/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{amineToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"organizer_id": "{{org}}", "marketing_push": false, "marketing_whatsapp": false}

### 7.10 Sara: code
POST {{base}}/fan/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "{{saraPhone}}"}

### 7.11 Sara: verify
POST {{base}}/fan/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "{{saraPhone}}", "code": "{{code}}"}

> {% client.global.set("saraToken", response.body.token); %}

### 7.12 Sara: joins with both opt-ins
PUT {{base}}/fan/me/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}
