{"organizer_id": "{{org}}", "marketing_push": true, "marketing_whatsapp": true}

### 7.13 Sara: leaves -> 204 (left: never exported)
DELETE {{base}}/fan/me/membership?organizer={{org}}
Authorization: Bearer {{saraToken}}

### ---------- (8) B9 "Exporter (CSV)" ----------

### 8.1 ADMIN: summary -> exportable (the file's row count) and marketing_whatsapp ("{exportable} fans · {n} avec téléphone")
GET {{base}}/org/members/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Organizer-Id: {{org}}

### 8.2 FINANCE: the export -> 403 (ADMIN only; OPS too)
GET {{base}}/org/crm/export.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
X-Organizer-Id: {{org}}

### 8.3 ADMIN: the export -> 200 text/csv, Cache-Control no-store, fans-{today}.csv: Yazid (oui;non), Karim with his
# phone (non;oui); no Amine, no Sara. Audit crm.export {rows, with_phone}, no name or phone.
GET {{base}}/org/crm/export.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Organizer-Id: {{org}}
